# Tailor product rules

Premium offline-first atelier PWA. Treat every change as ship-ready Play Store quality.

## Non-negotiables

- Performance: lazy-load heavy islands (Three, Konva, Recharts, jsPDF); keep route bundles lean; prefer `optimizePackageImports`.
- Accessibility / WCAG: skip link, labels, roles, focus, contrast, pinch-zoom allowed, honor `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- Responsive: mobile-first, safe-area insets, Apple-inspired spacing (`space-y-6`, generous padding).
- Offline / PWA: Serwist caching, IndexedDB (Dexie) with versioned migrations, graceful `/~offline`.
- Resilience: App Router `error.tsx` + feature error boundaries around WebGL/camera/Konva.
- Camera: request only on user gesture; clear denied / unsupported / HTTPS messaging.
- Visual system: teal atelier tokens, glassmorphism (`glass-panel`), premium gradients, Outfit/Syne typography, skeleton loaders, micro-interactions — no cream/terracotta AI clichés, no purple glow defaults.
- Code hygiene: no unused deps/components, no duplicated utilities, colocated feature modules.
- Tests + docs: unit/component coverage for core logic; keep README and `docs/` current including Vercel deploy.

## Stack notes

Next.js App Router (read `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before API changes), Tailwind v4, shadcn/ui, Framer Motion, Zustand, Dexie, Serwist.
